@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. GET / -> 200 OK (Kiểm tra trạng thái máy chủ)
GET {{host}}/

### 2. GET /api/assignments -> 200 OK (Lấy danh sách bài tập)
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. POST tạo lượt nộp hợp lệ -> 201 Created + header Location, status = received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 4. GET đọc lại lượt nộp vừa tạo: received -> processing -> graded (200 OK)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST thiếu dữ liệu (rỗng) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. POST bài tập không tồn tại (bài 99) -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 7. GET ID lượt nộp không tồn tại -> 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bắt tay SignalR negotiate -> 200 OK + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai đường dẫn hub (thiếu s: /hub/submissions) -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
